 t('<b>Why secularism matters</b>', '<b>J. S. Mill:</b> harm principle, individual freedom', '<b>John Rawls:</b> veil of ignorance, fairness', '<b>peace and harmony</b>', '<b>scientific temper and reform</b>', '<b>democracy</b>: equal participation'),
 OWN('IFPMD', 'Importance: <b>I</b>ndividual freedom (Mill) · <b>F</b>airness (Rawls) · <b>P</b>eace · <b>M</b>odernity · <b>D</b>emocracy.'),
 sec('COMMUNALISM', 'g'),
 t('<b>Meaning and types</b>', 'using religious identity to create <b>divisions and competing political interests</b>; treats communities as <b>homogeneous and conflicting</b>', '<b>majority communalism</b> (may pose as nationalism) and <b>minority communalism</b> (separatism, polarisation); both threaten secularism and integration'),
